# Concerted Effort ({2}{W}{W}): creatures you control gain protection until end of turn from whatever a creature you control has
# protection from - from spells that are one or more colors too (CR 702.16a). Show and Tell puts Emrakul, the Aeons Torn onto
# the battlefield on turn 3 (not cast, so no extra turn), and at Bot2's upkeep on turn 6 the Grizzly Bears gains its protection
# from colored spells: Bot2's red Shock can't target it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Concerted Effort
Show and Tell
Emrakul, the Aeons Torn
Grizzly Bears
Forest
Forest
Forest x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Shock
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain x10

